relational { relation Edge (src : i32 , dst : i32) ; r0 = rename Edge @ 1 { src - > b , dst - > c } ; r1 = rename Edge @ 0 { src - > a , dst - > b } ; r2 = semijoin r0 with r1 ; r3 = rename Edge @ 2 { src - > d , dst - > c } ; r5 = semijoin r2 with r3 ; r6 = semijoin r1 with r5 ; r7 = natural_join r6 with r5 ; r8 = natural_join r7 with r3 ; r9 = project r8 keep { a , d } ; output r9 as answer (a , d) ; }
